{"b":4,"c":15,"v":[[1,[["At the end of every seven years thou shalt make a release.",[[4,31,10],[1,21,2],[1,23,10],[1,23,11],[2,25,2],[2,25,3],[2,25,4],[22,61,1],[22,61,2],[22,61,3],[23,36,8],[23,36,9],[23,36,10],[23,36,11],[23,36,12],[23,36,13],[23,36,14],[23,36,15],[23,36,16],[23,36,17],[23,36,18],[41,4,18],[41,4,19]]]]],[2,[["exact it",[[15,5,7],[15,5,8],[15,5,9],[15,5,10],[15,5,11],[22,58,3],[29,8,4],[29,8,5],[29,8,6],[39,6,12],[39,6,14],[39,6,15],[39,18,25],[39,18,26],[39,18,27],[39,18,28],[39,18,29],[39,18,30],[39,18,31],[39,18,32],[39,18,33],[39,18,34],[39,18,35],[41,6,34],[41,6,35],[41,6,36],[41,6,37],[41,6,38],[41,7,42],[58,2,13]]]]],[3,[["Of a foreigner thou mayest exact it again: but that which is thine with thy brother thine hand shall release;",[[4,23,20],[1,22,25],[39,17,25],[39,17,26],[42,8,35],[45,6,6],[45,6,7],[47,6,10]]]]],[4,[["greatly bless",[[4,14,29],[4,28,1],[4,28,2],[4,28,3],[4,28,4],[4,28,5],[4,28,6],[4,28,7],[4,28,8],[4,28,11],[19,11,24],[19,11,25],[19,14,21],[19,28,27],[22,58,10],[22,58,11]]]]],[5,[["Only if thou carefully hearken unto the voice of the LORD thy God, to observe to do all these commandments which I command thee this day.",[[4,4,9],[4,11,13],[4,11,14],[4,11,15],[4,28,1],[4,28,2],[4,28,3],[4,28,4],[4,28,5],[4,28,6],[4,28,7],[4,28,8],[4,28,9],[4,28,10],[4,28,11],[4,28,12],[4,28,13],[4,28,14],[4,28,15],[2,26,3],[2,26,4],[2,26,5],[2,26,6],[2,26,7],[2,26,8],[2,26,9],[2,26,10],[2,26,11],[2,26,12],[2,26,13],[2,26,14],[5,1,7],[18,19,11],[22,1,19],[22,1,20],[49,1,27]]]]],[6,[["thou shalt lend",[[4,28,12],[4,28,44],[18,37,21],[18,37,26],[18,112,5],[19,22,7],[41,6,35]]],["thou shalt reign",[[4,28,13],[10,4,21],[10,4,24],[13,9,26],[14,4,20],[15,9,27]]]]],[7,[["thou shalt",[[4,15,9],[19,21,13],[39,18,30],[58,2,15],[58,2,16],[61,3,16],[61,3,17]]]]],[9,[["Beware",[[19,4,23],[23,17,10],[39,15,19],[40,7,21],[40,7,22],[44,7,8],[44,7,9],[58,4,5]]],["thine eye",[[4,28,54],[4,28,55],[4,28,56],[19,23,6],[19,24,9],[19,28,22],[39,20,15],[58,5,9],[59,4,9]]],["he cry",[[4,24,15],[1,3,7],[1,22,23],[17,34,28],[18,9,12],[19,21,13],[58,5,4]]],["sin unto thee",[[39,25,41],[39,25,42],[39,25,43],[39,25,44],[39,25,45],[58,4,17],[61,3,15],[61,3,16],[61,3,17]]]]],[10,[["thine heart",[[39,25,40],[43,20,35],[44,12,8],[46,9,5],[46,9,6],[46,9,7],[53,6,18],[53,6,19],[59,4,11]]],["because",[[4,15,4],[4,14,19],[4,14,29],[4,24,19],[18,41,1],[18,41,2],[19,11,24],[19,11,25],[19,22,9],[22,32,8],[22,58,10],[46,9,8],[46,9,9],[46,9,10],[46,9,11],[49,4,18],[49,4,19],[57,13,16]]]]],[11,[["the poor",[[19,22,2],[39,26,11],[40,14,7],[42,12,8]]],["Thou shalt",[[4,15,8],[39,5,42],[41,12,33],[43,2,45],[43,4,32],[43,4,33],[43,4,34],[43,4,35],[43,11,28],[43,11,29],[43,11,30],[46,8,2],[46,8,3],[46,8,4],[46,8,5],[46,8,6],[46,8,7],[46,8,8],[46,8,9],[61,3,16],[61,3,17],[61,3,18]]]]],[12,[["And if thy brother, an Hebrew man, or an Hebrew woman, be sold unto thee, and serve thee six years; then in the seventh year thou shalt let him go free from thee.",[[4,15,1],[1,21,2],[1,21,3],[1,21,4],[1,21,5],[1,21,6],[2,25,39],[2,25,40],[2,25,41],[23,34,14],[42,8,35],[42,8,36]]]]],[13,[["And when thou sendest him out free from thee, thou shalt not let him go away empty:",[[0,31,42],[1,3,21],[2,25,42],[2,25,43],[2,25,44],[19,3,27],[19,3,28],[23,22,13],[38,3,5],[50,4,1]]]]],[14,[["the Lord",[[15,8,10],[18,68,10],[19,10,22],[43,20,35],[45,16,2]]]]],[15,[["And thou shalt remember that thou wast a bondman in the land of Egypt, and the LORD thy God redeemed thee: therefore I command thee this thing to day.",[[4,5,14],[4,5,15],[4,16,12],[1,20,2],[22,51,1],[39,6,14],[39,6,15],[39,18,32],[39,18,33],[48,1,7],[48,2,12],[48,4,32],[48,5,1],[48,5,2],[55,2,14],[61,3,16],[61,4,9],[61,4,10],[61,4,11]]]]],[16,[["And it shall be, if he say unto thee, I will not go away from thee; because he loveth thee and thine house, because he is well with thee;",[[1,21,5],[1,21,6],[18,40,6],[18,40,8]]]]],[17,[["for ever",[[2,25,39],[2,25,40],[2,25,41],[2,25,42],[8,1,22]]]]],[18,[["a double",[[22,16,14],[22,21,16],[41,17,7],[41,17,8]]]]],[19,[["the firstling",[[1,13,2],[1,13,12],[1,34,19],[2,27,26],[3,3,13],[3,18,17],[44,8,29],[57,12,23]]],["thou shalt do",[[4,12,5],[4,12,6],[4,12,7],[4,12,17],[4,14,23],[4,16,11],[4,16,14],[3,18,15]]]]],[20,[["Thou shalt eat it before the LORD thy God year by year in the place which the LORD shall choose, thou and thy household.",[[4,12,5],[4,12,6],[4,12,7],[4,12,17]]]]],[21,[["And if there be any blemish therein, as if it be lame, or blind, or have any ill blemish, thou shalt not sacrifice it unto the LORD thy God.",[[4,17,1],[2,22,20],[2,22,24],[38,1,7],[38,1,8]]]]],[22,[["the unclean",[[4,12,15],[4,12,21],[4,12,22]]]]],[23,[["Only thou shalt not eat the blood thereof; thou shalt pour it upon the ground as water.",[[4,12,16],[4,12,23],[2,7,26],[8,14,32],[25,33,25]]]]]]}